| `reference_fragments.sets` | list of objects | `[]` in generated projects; keel lists both reference sets | each set names its output, head and folder; an empty list requires no fragment folders | `scripts/assemble_fragments.py` via `scripts/config_loader.py` | Keel assembles both references; generated projects edit them by hand and the check still rejects stray folders. | date stamping: `scripts/jobs/restamp_docs.py` | always |
